  "topic": "Participation",
  "national": true,
  "source_label": "05376: Apprentices, by region, age and year",
  "comparability": "Norway, national source (SSB table 05376, whole country). SSB's 'New apprentices' category: apprentices registered as new in the year, counted in the 1 October upper-secondary statistics; training candidates (lærekandidater) are not included. Upper-secondary (EQF 4) apprenticeships only. Age as at 31 December. This is an entry/flow measure, not the stock of apprentices; do not sum with other countries or with the stock series.",
